  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the man as the target of the insult",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man, as the meme's text 'shut up you meathead' directly addresses him. The deictic pronoun 'you' in the text explicitly projects the user's perspective onto the man, making him the direct recipient of the insult. The user is positioned as the one delivering the insult, while the man is the one being insulted. This projection is reinforced by the spatial placement of the text directly over and around the man's face, creating a direct visual and textual link between the user's implied action and the man's representation.",
